# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# When a real domain replaces the temporary *.pages.dev host, point this at it:
# a 301 keeps every published link working and preserves article paths.
#
# /*  https://example.com/:splat  301
#
# Probe: confirms this file is honoured on the project's *.pages.dev hostname
# too, not only on custom domains. Safe to delete once noted.
/redirect-test/*  https://example.com/:splat  301
